  "text" : {
    "status" : "generated",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ImplementationGuide dysphagia.care.transition</b></p><a name=\"dysphagia.care.transition\"> </a><a name=\"hcdysphagia.care.transition\"> </a><h2>DysphagiaCareTransitionIG</h2><p>The official URL for this implementation guide is: </p><pre>https://sefatuncer.github.io/stroke-dysphagia-fhir-ig/ImplementationGuide/dysphagia.care.transition</pre><div><p>Interoperable representation of swallowing assessment, aspiration risk, dysphagia severity and IDDSI diet across stroke care transitions (acute → rehab → home). Reuses SNOMED-embedded IDDSI/GUSS + clinical findings; contributes swallowing-assessment Observation profiles + IDDSI ValueSet/binding + a care-transition summary.</p>\n</div></div>"
